  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A bard of 3rd level or higher can use his performance to help an ally succeed at a task. The ally must be within 30 feet and able to see and hear the bard. The ally gets a +2 competence bonus on skill checks with a particular skill as long as he continues to hear the bard's performance. This bonus increases by +1 for every four levels the bard has attained beyond 3rd. Inspire competence relies on audible components.</p>",
